{
  "description": "An established Caatinga property has homes, food plots and useful equipment, but its pump and shared battery have failed. Iara, Bento and Nina welcome Luz and Cauã. Inspect what is already here, service it with real parts and make everyday water, sanitation and lighting dependable.",
  "format": "solar-friends-scenario",
  "id": "62e680e1-7362-4ce0-94fd-28e19bab2e40",
  "journal": {
    "chapters": [
      {
        "description": "The buildings already exist. Find the failed pump and shared battery, obtain their service kits and allow residents to do the work.",
        "goals": [
          {
            "condition": {
              "kind": "service",
              "minimum": 30,
              "minutes": 60,
              "service": "fresh_water"
            },
            "description": "Maintain 30 reachable fresh-water units for one observed hour. An inaccessible or empty tank does not help. Service the failed water pump; its kit uses fittings, plumbing and a tool.",
