            "optional": false,
            "title": "Reachable fresh water"
          }
        ],
        "id": "chapter-b5e766a1-4087-4572-a49f-ee99365d361f",
        "title": "Inspect before expanding"
      },
      {
        "description": "The inherited cable connects the solar farm and streetlight. Daytime generation alone cannot keep the path lit at night.",
        "goals": [
          {
            "condition": {
              "kind": "service",
              "minimum": 1,
              "minutes": 60,
              "service": "night_lights"
            },
            "description": "Keep one connected streetlight fully lit for one observed hour after dark. The shared battery needs resident service, electrical parts and a tool. Order tools through Supplies if local preparation cannot provide them yet.",
            "id": "goal-a11da03f-60d0-4711-9263-54ec826f3914",
            "optional": false,
            "title": "A dependable night light"
          }
        ],
        "id": "chapter-32bfce19-5be6-4436-85c3-3eec868c639f",
        "title": "Restore the evening path"
      },
      {
        "description": "Food and sanitation need physical supplies, local access and capacity. Starting structures do not grant service history.",
        "goals": [
          {
            "condition": {
              "kind": "service",
              "minimum": 1,
              "minutes": 60,
              "service": "toilets"
            },
            "description": "Maintain a reachable ecological toilet for one observed hour, with fresh handwashing water and room for greywater and sewage. The inherited sewage route leads to a banana treatment bed; it produces no edible bananas.",
